"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">This can be either a "
"remote or local repository location.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">You probably have a "
